https://xgm.guru/p/gamedev/resources
https://xgm.guru/files/100/235701/minimap.png
A tile with an image
))

A tile has its link, then an image or an icon, then a description. Tiles one after another make a row.

== Errors ==

A text always reads. What's reported, at its line:
- a block without its closing line: {{((cut}} without {{))}}, {{>>}} without {{<<}}, a code fence without its end
- a {{))}} or {{<<}} that closes nothing
